[offset:700]

[00:00.00] 作词 : Roger Waters
[00:00.00][by:无为世界]
[00:00.30] 作曲 : Roger Waters
[00:13.58]You know that I care what happens to you,
[00:13.58]你知道我关心你身上发生的事
[00:28.59]And I know that you care for me too.
[00:28.59]我知道你也关心我
[00:43.77]So I don't feel alone,
[00:43.77]那样我才不会感到孤独
[00:48.20]Or the weight of the stone,
[00:48.20]或内心沉甸甸的
[00:52.32]Now that I've found somewhere safe
[00:52.32]既然我已经找到安全的地方
[00:55.70]To bury my bone.
[00:55.70]来埋葬我的骨灰
[01:00.06]And any fool knows a dog needs a home,
[01:00.06]连傻子都知道狗需要一个家
[01:10.87]A shelter from pigs on the wing.
[01:10.87]一个免受飞翔猪袭击的避难之家
